  "description": "Is the infrastructure under the jobs healthy: CoreWeave control planes, nodes, GB200 racks, host resources, and the finelog mirrors and canary probes behind them. The current-state reads have no history and cover every cluster; the cluster selector applies to the host-resource charts, which come from the node agents' telemetry stream. Each row says which of the two it is.",
